{% comment %}
  Dr.Strips+ — "Beat the House" welcome popup
  ============================================
  A tic-tac-toe game against "the house" that ends by revealing an email
  capture, which reveals a discount code — see WIN ODDS below for how
  the outcome is decided.

  Restyled to match the site's Geist / near-black clinical design
  system (same fonts, colors and button conventions as the homepage
  and Science page) instead of the original navy/lime reference.

  TIMING: appears 7 seconds after page load, once per browser session
  (sessionStorage-gated) — see SHOW_DELAY_MS / SHOW_ONCE_PER_SESSION.

  The house now opens with the center square (a short "thinking" beat,
  then an O lands in the middle) as soon as the popup appears, so it's
  immediately obvious this is a live tic-tac-toe game against "the
  house" rather than a static graphic — see botOpensGame().

  WIN ODDS (added Sept 2026): each game rolls generous mode 75% of the
  time and competitive mode the other 25% (see houseCompetitive /
  botOpensGame). In generous mode the bot is provably unable to ever
  complete three in a row — pickBotMove only considers moves that leave
  it a guaranteed path to keep avoiding a win no matter how the visitor
  plays (see botHasNonWinningPath), so generous games always end in a
  player win or a draw, never a house win. In competitive mode the bot
  plays for real — takes a winning move when it has one, blocks the
  player otherwise — so the house has a genuine chance to win (in
  practice, against a reasonably attentive player, a large share of
  competitive-mode games do end in a house win or draw). Either way —
  win, lose, or draw — finishing the game reveals the email capture,
  which reveals the discount code; the outcome only changes the
  messaging shown, never whether the code unlocks.

  DISCOUNT CODE: displays "EARLY". Confirm a matching discount code
  exists in Shopify admin → Discounts before relying on this in
  production — nothing here creates the discount itself.

  EMAIL CAPTURE: the visible email input lives inside a native Shopify
  `form 'customer'` (#dsp-email-form) — the same mechanism as
  sections/landing-footer.liquid — which creates/updates a customer
  flagged as accepting email marketing, tagged "newsletter,welcome-popup".
  The visitor's own click submits it, so Shopify's automatic hCaptcha
  handling applies; do NOT switch this back to a scripted/hidden form or
  a fetch() POST (that failed with "Missing CAPTCHA token" or stalled
  behind ad blockers).

  The submit causes a brief page reload: Shopify redirects back with
  `?customer_posted=true`. On that reload this script cleans the URL and
  reopens the popup on the "code revealed" screen. If Shopify rejects the
  signup (`form.errors`), the popup reopens on the email step with the
  address restored, an error, and a "Play again" link.

  Once Klaviyo's Shopify app is connected, Klaviyo's own sync picks up
  any customer who accepts marketing automatically, so no further
  wiring is needed here when Klaviyo gets connected.
{% endcomment %}
<style>
  #dsp-overlay * {
    box-sizing: border-box;
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
  }
  #dsp-overlay {
    font-family: 'Geist', -apple-system, 'Helvetica Neue', Arial, sans-serif;
    position: fixed;
    inset: 0;
    z-index: 999999;
    background: rgba(11, 11, 12, 0.6);
    display: none;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 20px;
    opacity: 0;
    transition: opacity 0.3s ease;
  }
  #dsp-overlay.dsp-show {
    display: flex;
  }
  #dsp-overlay.dsp-visible {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  #dsp-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #ecedee;
    border-radius: 18px;
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 400px;
    padding: 32px 28px;
    position: relative;
    transform: translateY(16px) scale(0.97);
    transition: transform 0.35s cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.8, 0.2, 1);
    box-shadow: 0 30px 60px rgba(11, 11, 12, 0.28);
  }
  #dsp-overlay.dsp-visible #dsp-card {
    transform: translateY(0) scale(1);
  }
  #dsp-close {
    position: absolute;
    top: 14px;
    right: 14px;
    width: 30px;
    height: 30px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    border: none;
    background: transparent;
    color: #0b0b0c;
    font-size: 20px;
    line-height: 1;
    cursor: pointer;
    opacity: 0.5;
  }
  #dsp-close:hover {
    opacity: 1;
  }
  .dsp-eyebrow {
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #fff;
    background: #0b0b0c;
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 5px 11px !important;
    border-radius: 100px;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .dsp-h1 {
    font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 24px;
    line-height: 1.25;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
    color: #0b0b0c;
    margin-bottom: 6px;
  }
  .dsp-sub {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #55565a;
    margin-bottom: 22px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  /* --- board --- */
  #dsp-board {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 8px;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  /* .dsp-cell starts out empty (no marker yet) — the base theme hides all
     empty divs (div:empty{display:none}) for accessibility, and that
     selector actually outranks a single class, so this needs an explicit
     override to stay visible until a mark is placed. */
  .dsp-cell {
    background: #fafaf9;
    border: 1.5px solid #ecedee;
    border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex !important;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
    min-height: 142px;
  }
  .dsp-cell:hover:not(.dsp-taken) {
    border-color: #0b0b0c;
  }
  .dsp-cell.dsp-taken {
    cursor: default;
  }
  .dsp-cell svg {
    width: 46%;
    height: 46%;
  }
  .dsp-cell.dsp-win {
    background: #0b0b0c;
    border-color: #0b0b0c;
  }
  #dsp-board.dsp-thinking {
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }
  .dsp-status {
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8a8c91;
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    min-height: 16px;
  }
  /* --- email step --- */
  #dsp-email-step {
    display: none;
  }
  #dsp-email-step.dsp-active {
    display: block;
  }
  #dsp-game-step.dsp-hidden {
    display: none;
  }
  .dsp-win-banner {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .dsp-win-banner .dsp-h1 {
    margin-bottom: 4px;
  }
  #dsp-email-form {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
  }
  #dsp-email-input {
    font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif;
    font-size: 15px;
    padding: 13px 14px;
    border: 1.5px solid #dcdddf;
    border-radius: 9px;
    outline: none;
    background: #fff;
    color: #0b0b0c;
  }
  #dsp-email-input:focus {
    border-color: #0b0b0c;
    box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(11, 11, 12, 0.08);
  }
  .dsp-btn {
    font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 15px;
    background: #0b0b0c;
    color: #fff;
    border: none;
    border-radius: 9px;
    padding: 14px !important;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-bottom: 14px !important;
    transition: transform 0.12s cubic-bezier(0.22, 0.61, 0.36, 1), background 0.22s;
  }
  .dsp-btn:hover {
    background: #2a2b2e;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .dsp-btn:active {
    transform: scale(0.98);
  }
  .dsp-btn:disabled {
    opacity: 0.5;
    cursor: default;
  }
  .dsp-replay {
    font-family: 'Geist', sans-serif;
    font-size: 13px;
    background: none;
    border: none;
    color: #5c5e63;
    text-decoration: underline;
    cursor: pointer;
    margin-top: 12px;
    width: 100%;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .dsp-replay[hidden] {
    display: none;
  }
  .dsp-error {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #c0392b;
    min-height: 16px;
  }
  /* --- code reveal step --- */
  #dsp-code-step {
    display: none;
    text-align: center;
  }
  #dsp-code-step.dsp-active {
    display: block;
  }
  /* Steel-blue accent (#A5C8DC — the same tone used on the Science page's
     comparison chart and the password page's success message) marks the
     "prize" moment of the code reveal. */
  .dsp-code-card {
    background: #0b0b0c;
    border: 1.5px dashed #a5c8dc;
    border-radius: 14px;
    padding: 22px !important;
    margin: 18px 0 !important;
  }
  .dsp-code-label {
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #8a8c91;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }
  .dsp-code {
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-weight: 500;
    font-size: 32px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: #fff;
  }
  .dsp-code-terms {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #8a8c91;
    margin-top: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
  #dsp-copy-note {
    font-family: 'Geist Mono', ui-monospace, monospace;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: #a5c8dc;
    margin-top: 6px;
    min-height: 14px;
  }
  .dsp-visually-hidden {
    position: absolute !important;
    width: 1px !important;
    height: 1px !important;
    padding: 0 !important;
    margin: -1px !important;
    overflow: hidden !important;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0) !important;
    white-space: nowrap !important;
    border: 0 !important;
  }
</style>
<div id="dsp-overlay">
  <div id="dsp-card">
    <button id="dsp-close" aria-label="Close">&times;</button>
    <div id="dsp-game-step">
      <div class="dsp-h1">Beat us on Tic Tac Toe &amp; get $10 off.</div>
      <div class="dsp-sub">
        You're the cross, we're the circle. Win, lose, or draw — you'll unlock $10 off $50 either way.
      </div>
      <div id="dsp-board"></div>
      <div class="dsp-status" id="dsp-status">house moves first&hellip;</div>
    </div>
    <div id="dsp-email-step">
      <div class="dsp-win-banner">
        <span class="dsp-eyebrow" id="dsp-result-eyebrow">you won</span>
        <div class="dsp-h1" id="dsp-result-heading">Nice round.</div>
        <div class="dsp-sub" id="dsp-result-sub">
          Drop your email and we'll unlock your code — just a quick refresh.
        </div>
      </div>
      {%- comment -%}
        The visible form IS Shopify's native newsletter form (same as the
        landing footer), so the visitor's own click triggers Shopify's
        automatic captcha handling — no scripted submit or manual
        Shopify.captcha.protect().
      {%- endcomment -%}
      {%- form 'customer', id: 'dsp-email-form' -%}
        <input type="hidden" name="contact[tags]" value="newsletter,welcome-popup">
        {%- if form.errors -%}<input type="hidden" id="dsp-newsletter-errored" value="1">{%- endif -%}
        <input type="email" id="dsp-email-input" name="contact[email]" placeholder="you@email.com" required />
        <div class="dsp-error" id="dsp-email-error"></div>
        <button type="submit" class="dsp-btn" id="dsp-email-submit">Reveal my code</button>
      {%- endform -%}
      <button type="button" class="dsp-replay" id="dsp-replay" hidden>Play again</button>
    </div>
    <div id="dsp-code-step">
      <span class="dsp-eyebrow">get some rest</span>
      <div class="dsp-h1">$10 off, unlocked.</div>
      <div class="dsp-code-card">
        <div class="dsp-code-label">Your code</div>
        <div class="dsp-code" id="dsp-code-text">EARLY</div>
        {% comment %} <div id="dsp-copy-note">&nbsp;</div> {% endcomment %}
      </div>
      <button class="dsp-btn" id="dsp-copy-btn">Copy code</button>
      <div class="dsp-code-terms">$10 off orders $50+. One use per customer. Applied at checkout.</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link
  href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Geist:wght@400;500;600&family=Geist+Mono:wght@400;500&display=swap"
  rel="stylesheet"
>
<script>
  (function () {
    // ---- CONFIG ----
    var SHOW_DELAY_MS = 7000;
    var SHOW_ONCE_PER_SESSION = true;
    var DISCOUNT_CODE = 'EARLY';
    var STORAGE_KEY = 'dsp_seen_v1';
    var PENDING_KEY = 'dsp_pending_email';
    var WIN_LINES = [
      [0, 1, 2],
      [3, 4, 5],
      [6, 7, 8],
      [0, 3, 6],
      [1, 4, 7],
      [2, 5, 8],
      [0, 4, 8],
      [2, 4, 6],
    ];
    function checkWinner(board, mark) {
      for (var i = 0; i < WIN_LINES.length; i++) {
        var l = WIN_LINES[i];
        if (board[l[0]] === mark && board[l[1]] === mark && board[l[2]] === mark) return l;
      }
      return null;
    }
    function emptyCells(board) {
      var out = [];
      for (var i = 0; i < 9; i++) if (!board[i]) out.push(i);
      return out;
    }
    // Full look-ahead (the board has at most 9 cells, so this is cheap):
    // returns true if, from this state, the bot can play out the rest of
    // the game — no matter what the visitor does — without ever completing
    // three in a row itself. Used by generous mode below so it can rule out
    // not just an immediate win but any move that would eventually box the
    // bot into a forced win later (a real edge case in the previous
    // one-move-lookahead version of this function, caught during testing).
    function botHasNonWinningPath(board, botTurn) {
      if (checkWinner(board, 'O')) return false;
      var empties = emptyCells(board);
      if (checkWinner(board, 'X') || empties.length === 0) return true;
      if (botTurn) {
        for (var i = 0; i < empties.length; i++) {
          var next = board.slice();
          next[empties[i]] = 'O';
          if (checkWinner(next, 'O')) continue;
          if (botHasNonWinningPath(next, false)) return true;
        }
        return false;
      }
      for (var j = 0; j < empties.length; j++) {
        var reply = board.slice();
        reply[empties[j]] = 'X';
        if (!botHasNonWinningPath(reply, true)) return false;
      }
      return true;
    }
    // In generous mode (75% of games, the default) the bot picks only among
    // moves it can prove never lead to a house win, and prefers — among
    // those — one that doesn't block the visitor's winning move, so games
    // in this mode always end in a player win or a draw. In competitive
    // mode (the other 25%, see houseCompetitive) the bot plays for real: it
    // takes a winning move when it has one and blocks the player's winning
    // move otherwise, so the house has a genuine chance to win.
    function pickBotMove(board, competitive) {
      var empties = emptyCells(board);
      if (competitive) {
        for (var w = 0; w < empties.length; w++) {
          var testWin = board.slice();
          testWin[empties[w]] = 'O';
          if (checkWinner(testWin, 'O')) return empties[w]; // take the win
        }
        for (var b = 0; b < empties.length; b++) {
          var testBlock = board.slice();
          testBlock[empties[b]] = 'X';
          if (checkWinner(testBlock, 'X')) return empties[b]; // block the player
        }
        var preferredOrder = [4, 0, 2, 6, 8, 1, 3, 5, 7];
        for (var p = 0; p < preferredOrder.length; p++) {
          if (empties.indexOf(preferredOrder[p]) !== -1) return preferredOrder[p];
        }
        return empties[Math.floor(Math.random() * empties.length)];
      }
      var candidates = empties.filter(function (i) {
        var next = board.slice();
        next[i] = 'O';
        if (checkWinner(next, 'O')) return false; // never win immediately
        return botHasNonWinningPath(next, false); // ...or ever, down this path
      });
      var nonBlocking = candidates.filter(function (i) {
        var testX = board.slice();
        testX[i] = 'X';
        return !checkWinner(testX, 'X'); // prefer leaving the visitor's win open
      });
      var pool = nonBlocking.length ? nonBlocking : candidates.length ? candidates : empties;
      return pool[Math.floor(Math.random() * pool.length)];
    }
    function xIcon() {
      return '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M4 4L20 20M20 4L4 20" stroke="#0B0B0C" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>';
    }
    function oIcon() {
      return '<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8" stroke="#8A8C91" stroke-width="3.2"/></svg>';
    }
    document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded', function () {
      var overlay = document.getElementById('dsp-overlay');
      var boardEl = document.getElementById('dsp-board');
      var statusEl = document.getElementById('dsp-status');
      var gameStep = document.getElementById('dsp-game-step');
      var emailStep = document.getElementById('dsp-email-step');
      var codeStep = document.getElementById('dsp-code-step');
      var closeBtn = document.getElementById('dsp-close');
      var emailForm = document.getElementById('dsp-email-form');
      var emailInput = document.getElementById('dsp-email-input');
      var emailError = document.getElementById('dsp-email-error');
      var emailSubmitBtn = document.getElementById('dsp-email-submit');
      var replayBtn = document.getElementById('dsp-replay');
      var copyBtn = document.getElementById('dsp-copy-btn');
      var copyNote = document.getElementById('dsp-copy-note');
      var codeTextEl = document.getElementById('dsp-code-text');
      var unlockFallbackTimer = null;
      var resultEyebrowEl = document.getElementById('dsp-result-eyebrow');
      var resultHeadingEl = document.getElementById('dsp-result-heading');
      var resultSubEl = document.getElementById('dsp-result-sub');
      // Rolled fresh each game in botOpensGame(): 25% of games let the house
      // play competitively instead of always running in generous mode. See
      // pickBotMove and the WIN ODDS note at the top of this file.
      var houseCompetitive = false;
      codeTextEl.textContent = DISCOUNT_CODE;
      var board = new Array(9).fill(null);
      var over = false;
      function renderBoard() {
        boardEl.innerHTML = '';
        board.forEach(function (mark, i) {
          var cell = document.createElement('div');
          cell.className = 'dsp-cell' + (mark ? ' dsp-taken' : '');
          cell.dataset.i = i;
          if (mark === 'X') cell.innerHTML = xIcon();
          if (mark === 'O') cell.innerHTML = oIcon();
          cell.addEventListener('click', onCellClick);
          boardEl.appendChild(cell);
        });
      }
      function highlightWin(line) {
        var cells = boardEl.children;
        line.forEach(function (i) {
          cells[i].classList.add('dsp-win');
        });
      }
      function endGame(outcome) {
        // The code unlocks after the game regardless of outcome (see the
        // emailForm submit handler below) — winning is just for fun, so
        // every branch here still leads to the email step.
        over = true;
        if (outcome === 'house') {
          statusEl.textContent = 'house wins this round!';
          resultEyebrowEl.textContent = 'so close';
          resultHeadingEl.textContent = 'So close!';
          resultSubEl.textContent = "The house got this one — but your code's still unlocked. Drop your email below.";
        } else if (outcome === 'draw') {
          statusEl.textContent = "it's a draw!";
          resultEyebrowEl.textContent = 'good game';
          resultHeadingEl.textContent = "It's a draw.";
          resultSubEl.textContent = "Drop your email and we'll unlock your code — just a quick refresh.";
        } else {
          statusEl.textContent = 'you win!';
          resultEyebrowEl.textContent = 'you won';
          resultHeadingEl.textContent = 'Nice round.';
          resultSubEl.textContent = "Drop your email and we'll unlock your code — just a quick refresh.";
        }
        setTimeout(function () {
          gameStep.classList.add('dsp-hidden');
          emailStep.classList.add('dsp-active');
          emailInput.focus();
        }, 700);
      }
      // The house opens with the center square — a clear, deliberate first
      // move so it's obvious from the moment the card appears that this is
      // a live game against "the house" and not just a static graphic.
      // Also where each new game's odds are rolled: 25% of the time the
      // house plays competitively (see pickBotMove / houseCompetitive).
      function botOpensGame() {
        houseCompetitive = Math.random() < 0.25;
        boardEl.classList.add('dsp-thinking');
        setTimeout(function () {
          board[4] = 'O';
          renderBoard();
          boardEl.classList.remove('dsp-thinking');
          statusEl.textContent = 'your move';
        }, 650);
      }
      function onCellClick(e) {
        if (over) return;
        var i = parseInt(e.currentTarget.dataset.i, 10);
        if (board[i]) return;
        board[i] = 'X';
        renderBoard();
        var winLine = checkWinner(board, 'X');
        if (winLine) {
          highlightWin(winLine);
          endGame('player');
          return;
        }
        if (!emptyCells(board).length) {
          endGame('draw');
          return;
        }
        boardEl.classList.add('dsp-thinking');
        statusEl.textContent = 'house is thinking...';
        setTimeout(function () {
          var move = pickBotMove(board, houseCompetitive);
          board[move] = 'O';
          renderBoard();
          boardEl.classList.remove('dsp-thinking');
          var oLine = checkWinner(board, 'O');
          if (oLine) {
            highlightWin(oLine);
            endGame('house');
            return;
          }
          if (!emptyCells(board).length) {
            endGame('draw');
            return;
          }
          statusEl.textContent = 'your move';
        }, 500);
      }
      renderBoard();

      // Back to a fresh game — used by "Play again" when a signup fails, so a
      // visitor isn't stuck on the email step with no way to start over.
      function resetGame() {
        board = new Array(9).fill(null);
        over = false;
        clearTimeout(unlockFallbackTimer);
        emailSubmitBtn.disabled = false;
        emailSubmitBtn.textContent = 'Reveal my code';
        emailError.textContent = '';
        replayBtn.hidden = true;
        emailStep.classList.remove('dsp-active');
        gameStep.classList.remove('dsp-hidden');
        statusEl.textContent = 'house moves first\u2026';
        renderBoard();
        botOpensGame();
      }
      replayBtn.addEventListener('click', resetGame);

      function openPopupImmediately() {
        overlay.classList.add('dsp-show');
        requestAnimationFrame(function () {
          overlay.classList.add('dsp-visible');
        });
      }

      function showEmailError(msg) {
        emailSubmitBtn.disabled = false;
        emailSubmitBtn.textContent = 'Reveal my code';
        emailError.textContent = msg;
        replayBtn.hidden = false;
      }

      // Native submit: on a valid email we do NOT preventDefault — the form
      // posts to Shopify (via its own captcha handling) and the page reloads
      // with ?customer_posted=true, exactly like the landing footer signup.
      emailForm.addEventListener('submit', function (e) {
        var val = emailInput.value.trim();
        var ok = /^[^\s@]+@[^\s@]+\.[^\s@]+$/.test(val);
        if (!ok) {
          e.preventDefault();
          emailError.textContent = 'enter a valid email to unlock your code.';
          return;
        }
        emailError.textContent = '';
        // Remember the email so it can be restored if Shopify rejects it.
        try {
          sessionStorage.setItem(PENDING_KEY, val);
        } catch (err) {}
        // Disable after the submit has been dispatched, not during it.
        setTimeout(function () {
          emailSubmitBtn.disabled = true;
          emailSubmitBtn.textContent = 'Unlocking…';
        }, 0);
        // Stall guard: if the captcha check is blocked the page never
        // reloads. A real reload tears this timer down with the page.
        clearTimeout(unlockFallbackTimer);
        unlockFallbackTimer = setTimeout(function () {
          showEmailError(
            "We couldn't save your email — check your connection (or pause any ad blocker) and try again."
          );
        }, 12000);
      });

      copyBtn.addEventListener('click', function () {
        navigator.clipboard.writeText(DISCOUNT_CODE).then(function () {
          copyNote.textContent = 'copied!';
          setTimeout(function () {
            copyNote.textContent = ' ';
          }, 1500);
        });
      });
      function closePopup() {
        overlay.classList.remove('dsp-visible');
        setTimeout(function () {
          overlay.classList.remove('dsp-show');
        }, 300);
      }
      closeBtn.addEventListener('click', closePopup);
      overlay.addEventListener('click', function (e) {
        if (e.target === overlay) closePopup();
      });

      // Detect returning from a successful newsletter subscribe: Shopify
      // redirects back to the same page with ?customer_posted=true once
      // the `form` (type: 'customer') submission above completes. When
      // present, skip straight to the code step instead of restarting
      // the game or waiting out the normal 7-second delay, then clean
      // the URL so a page refresh doesn't repeat this.
      var params = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search);
      var submissionFailed = !!document.getElementById('dsp-newsletter-errored');
      if (submissionFailed) {
        // Shopify rejected the last signup (e.g. captcha failed). Reopen on the
        // email step with the address restored so the visitor can retry
        // instead of the signup vanishing silently.
        var pending = '';
        try {
          pending = sessionStorage.getItem(PENDING_KEY) || '';
        } catch (err) {}
        emailInput.value = pending;
        gameStep.classList.add('dsp-hidden');
        emailStep.classList.add('dsp-active');
        resultEyebrowEl.textContent = 'almost there';
        resultHeadingEl.textContent = "That didn't go through.";
        resultSubEl.textContent = 'Try your email again, or play another round.';
        showEmailError("We couldn't save your email — pause any ad blocker and try again.");
        // Un-mark the session so the game also comes back on the next page.
        try {
          sessionStorage.removeItem(STORAGE_KEY);
        } catch (err) {}
        openPopupImmediately();
        return;
      }
      if (params.get('customer_posted') === 'true') {
        try {
          sessionStorage.removeItem(PENDING_KEY);
        } catch (err) {}
        gameStep.classList.add('dsp-hidden');
        codeStep.classList.add('dsp-active');
        openPopupImmediately();
        try {
          sessionStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, '1');
        } catch (err) {}
        params.delete('customer_posted');
        var cleanedSearch = params.toString();
        var cleanedUrl =
          window.location.pathname +
          (cleanedSearch ? '?' + cleanedSearch : '') +
          window.location.hash.replace('#dsp-email-form', '');
        window.history.replaceState(null, '', cleanedUrl);
        return;
      }

      var alreadySeen = SHOW_ONCE_PER_SESSION && sessionStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY);
      if (!alreadySeen) {
        setTimeout(function () {
          openPopupImmediately();
          botOpensGame();
          if (SHOW_ONCE_PER_SESSION) sessionStorage.setItem(STORAGE_KEY, '1');
        }, SHOW_DELAY_MS);
      }
    });
  })();
</script>
